<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $66-1/8 (FIM 316.50).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $66-1/8 (FIM 316.50).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed down $0-3/4 at $66-1/8 in New York on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Nokia's Wall Street closing equals about 316.50 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Tuesday, Nokia A closed down 1.60 at 313.50.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed down $1 at $33 on Wall Street. The price equals about 79.00 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed down 1.60 markka at 78.50.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR ended down $0-1/4 at $19-3/4 in New York on Tuesday. The price corresponds to about 95.50 markka. In Helsinki, Rauma closed flat at 95.00 markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
